Subject: [PATCH] feat: completion quality gates respect review

X-Jcode-Patch-Intent: Skip automatic post-completion todo quality
continuations when auto-review and auto-judge are both disabled.
X-Jcode-Patch-Kind: personal-feature
X-Jcode-Patch-Depends-On: 1003-personal-feature-add-worker-blueprints-with-runtime-integration.patch

Patch intent:
Make automatic ownership, validation, and final-response todo continuations
conditional on at least one automatic review workflow being enabled.

Why it exists:
Users who disable both automatic review and automatic judging expect jcode not
to add extra post-completion verification work. Incomplete-work progress pokes
remain available, and either enabled workflow preserves the existing gates.

Upstream integration points:
crates/jcode-tui/src/tui/app/input.rs schedules todo completion continuations
from App::schedule_auto_poke_followup_if_needed. Its review-state fields track
the session-level autoreview and autojudge feature settings.

Update guidance:
Keep the guard before every completed-todo quality continuation. Do not disable
incomplete-work progress reminders, and require both review settings to be off.

Validation:
scripts/cargo_exec.sh test -p jcode-tui completion_quality_gates_are_disabled_only_when_review_and_judge_are_off --lib
---
 crates/jcode-tui/src/tui/app/input.rs          | 15 +++++++++++++++
 .../tui/app/tests/remote_events_reload_05.rs   | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 33 insertions(+)

diff --git a/crates/jcode-tui/src/tui/app/input.rs b/crates/jcode-tui/src/tui/app/input.rs
index 3d3f98530..e7c9e6842 100644
--- a/crates/jcode-tui/src/tui/app/input.rs
+++ b/crates/jcode-tui/src/tui/app/input.rs
@@ -1717,6 +1717,21 @@ impl App {
                 self.last_todo_ownership_fingerprint = None;
                 return false;
             }
+            // The completion gates are the prompt-side counterpart to the
+            // automatic review and judging workflows. When both workflows
+            // are disabled, do not add ownership, validation, or synthetic
+            // final-response instructions after the agent has completed its
+            // todos. Keep incomplete-work pokes active above: those are
+            // progress reminders, not post-completion quality checks.
+            if !self.autoreview_enabled && !self.autojudge_enabled {
+                self.todo_final_response_requested = false;
+                self.last_todo_ownership_fingerprint = None;
+                self.todo_completion_gate_attempts = 0;
+                self.todo_confidence_spike_challenged = false;
+                self.todo_gate_digest_delivered = false;
+                self.pending_queued_dispatch = false;
+                return false;
+            }
             // Deferred quality checks land here, once, instead of interrupting
             // every todo write during the turn. Every point recorded during the
             // turn is raised, including ones whose score later climbed: work
diff --git a/crates/jcode-tui/src/tui/app/tests/remote_events_reload_05.rs b/crates/jcode-tui/src/tui/app/tests/remote_events_reload_05.rs
index df65bb30d..48dd1324c 100644
--- a/crates/jcode-tui/src/tui/app/tests/remote_events_reload_05.rs
+++ b/crates/jcode-tui/src/tui/app/tests/remote_events_reload_05.rs
@@ -481,6 +481,24 @@ fn dispatch_ownership_followup(app: &mut App) {
     app.pending_queued_dispatch = false;
 }
 
+#[test]
+fn completion_quality_gates_are_disabled_only_when_review_and_judge_are_off() {
+    with_temp_jcode_home(|| {
+        let mut app = create_test_app();
+        app.auto_poke_incomplete_todos = true;
+        app.autoreview_enabled = false;
+        app.autojudge_enabled = false;
+        save_unfinished_ownership_fixture(&app.session.id);
+
+        assert!(!app.schedule_auto_poke_followup_if_needed());
+        assert!(app.queued_messages.is_empty());
+        assert_eq!(app.todo_completion_gate_attempts, 0);
+
+        app.autojudge_enabled = true;
+        dispatch_ownership_followup(&mut app);
+    });
+}
+
